  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Kiriati‐Yearimu bagaacha, bakaira Esanduki eria y’Omonene, bakayebeka ase enyomba y’Abinadabu, ase ekegoro igoro; bagachoora na gwatanana Eleazari, omwana oye omomura, abe okorenda Esanduki eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samweli okogaambera Abaisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa engaki eyio Esanduki eria y’Omonene ekabeera agwo Kiriati-Yearimu ase engaki entaambe, emiaka emerongo ebere. Ase engaki eyio yonsi, Abaisraeli bonsi bakaba bakorera ase Omonene ng’a abakoonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Samweli agateebia Abaisraeli bonsi: “Onye mogochia koonchoka na koirana ase Omonene ne chinkoro chiaino chionsi, morusie korwa ase more chinyasae chingeni chionsi, amo n’Asitaroti, mokorere Omonene bweka; erio nario arabatoorie korwa ase amaboko yabafilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abaisraeli bakarusia korwa ase bare chinyasae chiria Baali na Asitaroti, bakamokorera Omonene bweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli agateeba, “Sangereria Abaisraeli bonsi agwo Misipa, erinde imbasabere aroro ase Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagasangererekana agwo Misipa, bakabuucha amaache, bakayaumora agwo ase obosio bw’Omonene, bakeng’ata ase rituko erio, bagakwana aroro agwo, “Twakorire ebibe ase Omonene.” Erio Samweli akaba okogaambera Abaisraeli agwo Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abafirisiti baigwete ng’a Abaisraeli basangererekanire agwo Misipa, abanene b’Abafilisti bakagenda gochia kobarwania. Abaisraeli bagachia koigwa amang’ana ayio, bakabairoka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagateebia Samweli, “Tobaisa gotiga kogenderera gotosabera ase Omonene, Nyasae oito, ng’a atotoorie korwa ase amaboko y’Abafilisti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Samweli akaimokia emaanwa y’eng’ondi ekogonka, akayerua ase Omonene ekaba ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa ekegima, agasabera Abaisraeli ase Omonene, n’Omonene akaigwa ogosaba kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Samweli areenge korua ekeng’wanso keria ki’ogosaambwa, Abafirisiti bagaacha korwania Abaisraeli, korende Omonene akabarentera okogukura okonene gwe chinkoba korwa igoro, akabataantania, na Abaisraeli bakabua Abafirisiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bakaimoka korwa agwo Misipa, bakabwatia Abafirisiti goika Beti‐Kari, bakabaitera ’nchera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Samweli akaimokia rigena, akaritenenia gati ya Misipa na Seni, akariroka Ebeni‐Eseri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "akabora: “Omonene otokonyire twaikire aiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo Abafirisiti bakabugwa, tibanyora ribaga naende gosoa ase ense y’Abaisraeli. Okoboko kw’Omonene nigo kwareenge mamincha y’Abafilisti ase amatuko onsi Samweli areenge moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emechie yonsi egati y’Ekironi na Gati, eyio Abafirisiti konya baurire Abaisraeli, ekairanigwa amo ne chingongo chiaetanaineo. Agwo boigo omorembe okaba ase egati y’Abaisraeli na Abaamori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli akaba omogambi ebiina bw’Abaisraeli ase amatuko onsi areenge moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omwaka akaba okogenda goika Beteli, na Giligali, na Misipa, akaba okogaambera Abaisraeli ebiina ase emechie eyio yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akaba okoirana Rama, ekiagera agwo nao bwoye yarenge, na agwo akaba okogaamba ebiina bi’Abaisraeli, naende akaagachera Omonene egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
